900 C1$="David spoke.":C2$="Susanna spoke.":C3$="The Devil King spoke.":C4$="The King of the North spoke."
1500 GOSUB 6100:BM$="When he opened his eyes, David was standing in front of Susanna's room.\He had been transported from the wilderness to the castle in an instant.":GOSUB 5100
1510 GOSUB 6110:GOSUB 6310:BM$="He opened the door, and he found Susanna there.":GOSUB 5100
1520 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I've been waiting for you, David. Come on, we have to go to the\basement. Everyone's worried because you've been taking so long.":GOSUB 5100
1530 BM$="Susanna: Hurry, David! You must witness the blood of that man before the\star of darkness leaves the planet!":GOSUB 5100
1540 BM$="Susanna grasped his hand tightly.":GOSUB 5100
1550 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Enough of this! I don't want to kill anyone!":GOSUB 5100
1555 GOSUB 9010:GOSUB 9050:GOSUB 6120:BM$="All of a sudden, the other David appeared at his side.":GOSUB 5100
1560 BM$="Other David: Susanna, there is no choice. We must kill the other David.\There cannot be two Davids.":GOSUB 5100:'
1570 BM$="The other David approached him, brandishing a knife.":GOSUB 5100
1580 BM$="David: Let go of me, Susanna! I must run! If I don't run, he's going to kill me!":GOSUB 5100
1590 BM$="David tried to pry Susanna's fingers open, but they were as stiff as iron,\and would not budge.":GOSUB 5100
1600 GOSUB 6130:BM$="The other David raised the knife...":GOSUB 5100
