1900 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Tell me, doctor. Will he get any better?":GOSUB 5100
1910 BM$="Susanna was talking to a doctor from the mental hospital David had been\recovering in. She had been taking care of him all this time.":GOSUB 5100
1920 BM$="Susanna: You said he's been dreaming for a month now... What's going to\happen to him?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1930 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Doctor: As you can see from this EEG, his brain activity is abnormal. See\how many ripples there are? His brainwaves are in complete disarray.":GOSUB 5100
1940 BM$="Doctor: This is the kind of pattern caused by fear, a nightmare perhaps...\But normally the shock would wake you up instantly. It's as if he's secluded\himself in the dreamworld in order to escape from reality.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1950 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Sometimes celebrities can't cope with their popularity. Maybe he\just wants to be... alone.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1960 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Doctor: Though these violent brain waves are not desirable, the silver\lining is that even in the worst case scenario he won't fall into a\vegetative state.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1965 BM$="Doctor: Eventually, his dreams may become so horrible that he'd rather\return to reality and wake up.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1970 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Doctor, is he able to hear me while he sleeps?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1980 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Doctor: While his EEG is calm he is sound asleep and he won't be able to hear\you. He should be able to hear you when his brainwaves are spiking. I must\inform you, however, that it will only be a fleeting memory to him.":GOSUB 5100
1990 BM$="Doctor: I understand how you feel, Ms. Susanna, but please take care of\yourself as well. This kind of condition requires a lot of time and patience.":GOSUB 5100
2000 BM$="With that, the doctor left. Alone with David, Susanna moved closer to his\ear, and spoke to him, caressing her belly.":GOSUB 5100
2010 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: David... Our baby's growing well. Please, wake up soon. I want the\three of us to live together.":GOSUB 5100
2020 BM$="David did not react, but Susanna felt like she heard a voice.":GOSUB 5100
2030 BM$="`...And so, my bloodline shall carry over. Well done, Susanna. I shall return to\the star of darkness and rest. I look forward to my return, 300 years from\now...`":GOSUB 5100
2040 BM$="Susanna: It's the voice of King Hroth... Once he returns to the star of\darkness, David will wake up, I'm sure of it...":GOSUB 5100
2050 BM$="Excited for David's imminent awakening, Susanna started replying to the\pile of letters the fans sent David during his stay at the hospital.":GOSUB 5100
